From: Mahalakshmi Kailasam <mahalakshmik@ami.com>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ARM: dts: aspeed: tiogapass: enable KVM devices

Enable the AST2500 video engine and USB virtual hub used by obmc-ikvm for
video capture and virtual keyboard and mouse input.

Signed-off-by: Mahalakshmi Kailasam <mahalakshmik@ami.com>
Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [platform specific]
---
 arch/arm/boot/dts/aspeed/aspeed-bmc-facebook-tiogapass.dts | 8 ++++++++
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm/boot/dts/aspeed/aspeed-bmc-facebook-tiogapass.dts b/arch/arm/boot/dts/aspeed/aspeed-bmc-facebook-tiogapass.dts
--- a/arch/arm/boot/dts/aspeed/aspeed-bmc-facebook-tiogapass.dts
+++ b/arch/arm/boot/dts/aspeed/aspeed-bmc-facebook-tiogapass.dts
@@ -48,6 +48,14 @@ iio-hwmon {
 
 };
 
+&video {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+&vhub {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
 &fmc {
 	status = "okay";
 	flash@0 {
-- 
